  "notes": [
    "Standalone Splendor Duel base game only. The Counterfeiters expansion, standard Splendor and other editions are excluded.",
    "The SVG is an original text-free whole-table schematic. It uses a 5×5 token lattice rotated 45 degrees to present the diamond board; the center-out clockwise spiralOrder is a stable asset index, not a claim that every printed copy uses those exact logical row/column coordinates.",
    "The 12 visible Jewel card positions, three face-down level decks, 25 random token spaces, three shared Privilege supply symbols, four Royal offers, two public player tableaus, and two owner-only reserved-card zones are all present.",
    "Card identities, deck order, random token-to-space assignment, each player’s acquired cards/tokens/privileges, Royal-card ownership, reserved cards and turn/pending state remain dynamic JSON data; the SVG does not seed or infer a game state.",
    "The victory tile is represented by three original neutral symbols; the accompanying JSON gives the exact victory thresholds. No publisher card or token artwork is copied.",
    "This package is a board and state-layout asset only. It does not add application rendering, editing, save/resume integration, action legality or scoring code."
